1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,120
(Sheldon:)but the smell of burning books

2
00:00:02,286 --> 00:00:05,126
(Sheldon:)reminds me of church picnics
in East Texas.

3
00:00:07,057 --> 00:00:08,657
(Howard:)What's this?

4
00:00:08,826 --> 00:00:12,506
(Sheldon:)That's just a doodle of
a hyperelliptic Riemann surface.

5
00:00:12,663 --> 00:00:15,573
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah. Wasn't that the basis
of your postdoc fellowship?

6
00:00:15,732 --> 00:00:17,072
(Sheldon:)It was.

7
00:00:17,234 --> 00:00:19,714
(Sheldon:)This seemed so elegant
at the time,

8
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:23,040
(Sheldon:)but now I realize I was just
a simple country boy,

9
00:00:23,207 --> 00:00:25,707
(Sheldon:)seduced by a big city theory

10
00:00:25,876 --> 00:00:28,216
(Sheldon:)with variables
in all the right places.

11
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,150
(Raj:)-It's going to be OK.
-I know.

12
00:00:32,316 --> 00:00:34,356
(Sheldon:)As hard as this is,
I have to move on.

13
00:00:34,518 --> 00:00:37,228
(Sheldon:)I can't keep postulating
multidimensional entities

14
00:00:37,387 --> 00:00:39,057
(Sheldon:)and get nothing in return.

15
00:00:39,223 --> 00:00:42,033
(Sheldon:)I have needs, too.

16
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:50,170
(Howard:)So, you and Emily
still together?

17
00:00:56,006 --> 00:00:58,216
(Howard:)I spoke to Bernadette.
She's free tomorrow night.

18
00:00:58,375 --> 00:00:59,445
OK, great.

